# The packages that build vtium's documentation site (ADR-1502 D5).
# requirements.txt pins them, with the hash of every file of every package,
# and is compiled from this file with:
#   uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 --no-header tools/site/requirements.in -o tools/site/requirements.txt
# A change of the pin is a commit of its own.
